{"unit_id":"good-saltfish__dsh-auto-rerun#card-zh","repo":"good-saltfish/dsh-auto-rerun","commit":"dce9517650c2808a702eee5f616a8e7ba953cf69","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-rerun 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的宿主插件，用于在模型请求遇到网络断连、限流或服务端暂时错误时自动恢复。它在请求错误事件上接管内置重试结束后的可恢复失败，按服务端 Retry-After、错误文本提示或退避窗口安排下一次请求；默认在同一模型上持续重试，并设有两小时上限。终态断连还可触发有限次数的回合续跑，模型路线切换为可选功能。右侧栏面板显示运行状态并允许调整开关和预算，适合希望 DSH 任务从短暂模型故障中恢复的用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1344-1403","index.js:1547-1605","client.js:373-392"]}
{"unit_id":"good-saltfish__dsh-auto-rerun#card-en","repo":"good-saltfish/dsh-auto-rerun","commit":"dce9517650c2808a702eee5f616a8e7ba953cf69","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-auto-rerun is a DSH web host plugin that retries recoverable model request failures using provider delay hints and backoff, with a two-hour ceiling by default. It can submit capped follow-up turns, optionally switch model routes, and offers a sidebar for status and retry controls.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1344-1403","index.js:1547-1605","client.js:373-392"]}
